        "description": "For new records only, resolved before serialization. Historical missing-field decoding stays immutable. No origin, identity, type, evidence or provenance templates: producer-bearing records require explicit origin. Supplied fields are preserved and validated. Confidence is a creation prior only when inserted; applied_defaults records exact JSON pointers and effective profile_hash. Nested project domain kinds/slots/relations use the same local profile."
      }
